{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"746813469587931166","content":"Coming off of seasons 3, The result of the barrier going back up, this time with a filter is going to allow neutral gods to come to Arcania to flee the renewed war between the good god and the evil gods which was rekindled by the knights resurrections. The goal here is to make Arcania feel like a sanctuary that matches the inscription on the statue of liberty.  \n\"Give me your tired, your poor,\nYour huddled masses yearning to breathe free,\nThe wretched refuse of your teeming shore.\nSend these, the homeless, tempest-tost to me,\nI lift my lamp beside the golden door!\"","created_at":"2020-08-22T19:34:10.290000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746814493069410415","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
